async function chooseFiles(options={}){if(options.directory)throw Error('浏览器嵌入画布不能选择本机目录；请选择文件或使用统一素材库');const extensions=extensionsOf(options),input=document.createElement('input');input.type='file';input.multiple=!!options.multiple;input.accept=extensions.map(x=>'.'+x).join(',');input.dataset.dshFilePicker='true';input.style.display='none';document.body.append(input);return new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{let done=false;const finish=(fn,value)=>{if(done)return;done=true;input.remove();fn(value);};input.addEventListener('cancel',()=>finish(resolve,null),{once:true});input.addEventListener('change',async()=>{try{const files=[...input.files];if(!files.length)return finish(resolve,null);for(const file of files)if(extensions.length&&!extensions.some(ext=>file.name.toLowerCase().endsWith('.'+ext)))throw Error('所选文件类型不符合筛选要求');const paths=[];for(const file of files)paths.push((await uploadBrowserFile(file)).path);finish(resolve,options.multiple?paths:paths[0]);}catch(error){finish(reject,error);}},{once:true});input.click();});}
async function exportName(options={}){const suggested=String(options.defaultPath||options.suggestedName||'导出文件').split(/[\\/]/).pop(),extensions=extensionsOf(options);const dialog=document.createElement('dialog');dialog.dataset.dshSaveDialog='true';dialog.style.cssText='background:#202226;color:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #65686d;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;min-width:300px;max-width:80vw;z-index:2147483647';dialog.innerHTML='<form method="dialog"><h3>保存到本项目并下载</h3><label>文件名 <input data-dsh-export-name required maxlength="240"></label><p data-dsh-export-error role="alert"></p><p>导出完成后可在“导出文件”中下载。</p><button value="cancel" type="button" data-cancel>取消</button> <button value="save" type="submit">保存</button></form>';dialog.querySelector('input').value=suggested;document.body.append(dialog);return new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{let settled=false;const finish=value=>{if(settled)return;settled=true;dialog.close();dialog.remove();resolve(value);};dialog.addEventListener('cancel',event=>{event.preventDefault();finish(null);});dialog.querySelector('[data-cancel]').onclick=()=>finish(null);dialog.querySelector('form').onsubmit=async event=>{event.preventDefault();const name=dialog.querySelector('input').value.trim();if(!name||/[\\/\x00-\x1f]/.test(name)||['.','..'].includes(name)){dialog.querySelector('[role=alert]').textContent='请填写有效文件名';return;}if(extensions.length&&!extensions.some(ext=>name.toLowerCase().endsWith('.'+ext))){dialog.querySelector('[role=alert]').textContent='文件名需要以 '+extensions.map(x=>'.'+x).join(' 或 ')+' 结尾';return;}try{const target=await rpc('canvas_export_begin',{name});pendingExports.set(target.path,target);finish(target);}catch(error){dialog.querySelector('[role=alert]').textContent=error.message;}};dialog.showModal();dialog.querySelector('input').focus();});}
function appendDownload(value,auto=false){mountDownloads();const row=document.createElement('p'),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=fileUrl(value.path);a.download=value.name||value.path.split('/').pop();a.textContent=(value.name||a.download)+' · '+value.bytes+' 字节';a.style.color='#b9f1db';row.append(a);downloadsPanel.querySelector('[data-dsh-export-list]').prepend(row);downloadsPanel.hidden=false;if(auto)a.click();}
function mountDownloads(){if(downloadsPanel)return;const button=document.createElement('button');button.type='button';button.textContent='导出文件';button.dataset.dshExports='true';button.style.cssText='position:fixed;right:16px;bottom:16px;z-index:2147483600;background:#252a2c;color:#f3f4f4;border:1px solid #626c69;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px';downloadsPanel=document.createElement('section');downloadsPanel.hidden=true;downloadsPanel.dataset.dshExportPanel='true';downloadsPanel.style.cssText='position:fixed;right:16px;bottom:60px;z-index:2147483600;max-width:460px;max-height:50vh;overflow:auto;padding:16px;background:#202629;color:#fff;border:1px solid #626c69;border-radius:8px';downloadsPanel.innerHTML='<strong>本项目导出文件</strong><div data-dsh-export-list></div>';button.onclick=async()=>{if(!downloadsPanel.hidden){downloadsPanel.hidden=true;return;}try{const files=await rpc('canvas_list_exports');downloadsPanel.querySelector('[data-dsh-export-list]').textContent=files.length?'':'还没有导出文件';for(const file of files)appendDownload(file);downloadsPanel.hidden=false;}catch(error){downloadsPanel.querySelector('[data-dsh-export-list]').textContent=error.message;downloadsPanel.hidden=false;}};document.body.append(button,downloadsPanel);}
